== Effects ==
* Has a chance to inflict [[burning]] on enemies upon entering a new room.
** The chance to inflict burning increases with [[luck]]. It goes from 20% at base luck up to 100% at 40 luck.
** The burn inflicted by Lighter deals Isaac's damage per tick, up to 5 times.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 33% and having both to 50%.
* {{T|Tick|r+}}: Tick can be removed by picking up A Lighter.

== Trivia ==
* This trinket is from the ''Antibirth'' mod where it was called [[anti:Lighter|Lighter]]. In ''Antibirth'' the trinket would make all farts explode harming both enemies and Isaac alike.
* The description is likely a reference to Alfred's line in The Dark Knight "Some men just want to watch the world burn".

